    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="8e827760-0265-59aa-bcec-17222e9c6a7f" activityNameId="652e9eaa-1473-5d5d-843a-43f61c050574" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methanol plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methanol plant
Methanol plant with a daly production of 2700 t methanol. Life time of plant assumed with 30 years.;
UUID: c601909c-477e-3a5b-8064-3829b0be443e
Requirements for materials for the infrastructure. Estimates on energy use for construction. Transport of materials to construction site. Dismatnteling of plant and disposal. Land useand occupation for plant.
Location: Estimated data refers on a new plant built in Sibiria. Land use consideredwith different plant sites from different regions.
Technology: Plant with modern design asessed.  Only materials included but no production of the parts. Estimates for the energy used in building and dismantling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Infrastructure data obtained from literature. Land use data from literature and porject data for recently built plants. 
Extrapolations: Infrastructure data from one plant applied for the whole production. Therefore higher uncertainity. Land use asessed and extrapolated with average data from different plants. This value has a large range, so the uncertainity of the value is still high.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c601909c-477e-3a5b-8064-3829b0be443e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
